troparion.text:
In his sufferings, Thy martyr Callinicus O Lord,
received an imperishable crown from Thee, our God;
for, possessed of Thy might,
he set at naught the tyrants and crushed the feeble audacity of the demons.//
By his supplications save Thou our souls.

kontakion.text:
The beautiful things of heaven
hast thou now inherited as is meet;
for, greatly aflame with the love of Christ,
thou didst manfully brave the fire therewith, O Callinicus.//
Standing now before Him, cease not to pray on behalf of us all.

